<title>SLOVENIA: TABLE - Slovenia May trade gap narrows to $109.7 mln.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Slovenia May trade gap narrows to $109.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>			 May   April  May 96  Jan-May 97 Jan-May96</p>
<p>    Trade balance -109.7 -126.4  -175.7   -555.5    -472.5</p>
<p>    Exports	  679.8  749.4   673.6   3,370.2   3,456.1</p>
<p>    Imports	  789.5  875.8   849.3   3,925.7   3,928.6</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
